00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067 line:92%
-I want to talk, obviously

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:04.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
about what's happened
the last few days with Iran.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:06.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
