00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:08.561 size:88% position:44%
you have to think about
the use of our military.

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:10.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have the finest militar
on earth.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.399 size:88% position:44%
