anything we ask them to do

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:18.471 line:92%
They will make any sacrifice

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:23.176
But that means the Commander
in Chief has to understand

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:24.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we should not
ask our military

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:28.848
to try to solve problems tha
cannot be solved militarily.

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:31.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have to be willing
to use our diplomatic tools.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:34.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have to be willing to use
our economic tools.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have to be willing
to work with our allies.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:40.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have to be willing to d
the quiet, careful work

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:43.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
of back channels
to work together.

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:48.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
Remember, Iran, yes, a natio
that takes many bad acts.

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:49.903 line:92%
But working with our allies,

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:51.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
we got them to
the negotiating table.

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:57.010
We got them to agree to give u
