00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:00.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
We can make diplomacy work
but it's hard work.

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:06.753
It's painstaking work. But it'
something I will be committed to

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:08.254 size:81% position:41% line:92%
